Author: AIwork4me <AIwork4me@qq.com>
Date:   Sun Aug 30 09:10:56 2026 +0000

    [Bugfix][Multimodal] Forward only present RoPE grid kwargs
    
    The generic Transformers multimodal backend unconditionally forwarded image_grid_thw and video_grid_thw to the HF model's get_rope_index, even when the corresponding grid was absent. Not every signature accepts both keywords: HunYuanVL accepts image_grid_thw but has no video_grid_thw parameter, so an image-only HunyuanOCR request reached it with video_grid_thw=None and raised a TypeError.
    
    Only add image/video grid kwargs when the corresponding grid is present. No model-specific handling is introduced; every HF get_rope_index defaults both grid kwargs to None, so signatures that do accept them are unaffected.
    
    Found while validating HunyuanOCR after the migration to the Transformers modeling backend (#53615).
    
    Co-authored-by: ZCode Agent
    Signed-off-by: AIwork4me <AIwork4me@qq.com>

